    "detailed_description": "Welcome to an immersive audio-only adventure where sight is no longer necessary. Navigate through soundscapes, relying solely on your ears to guide you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120790/extras/99c3bf214d48fd74314bcaecafbef0d1.poster.avif?t=1732112877\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120790/extras/99c3bf214d48fd74314bcaecafbef0d1.webm?t=1732112877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120790/extras/99c3bf214d48fd74314bcaecafbef0d1.mp4?t=1732112877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key Features:<br><br>Sonar Navigation: Use sonar pings to map out your surroundings and find your way through uncharted territories.<br>Follow the Music: Let the sound of music lead you to hidden entrances and important locations.<br>Encounter Snake Enemies: Beware of the snakes that lurk in the shadows. Listen carefully for their hisses and slithers to avoid danger.<br>Immersive Audio Experience: Dive into a richly detailed world brought to life through high-quality sound design. Every sound tells a story and helps you on your journey.<br>Simple Controls: Intuitive and accessible controls ensure that players of all abilities can enjoy the game.<br>No Graphics, Only Sound: Experience a game where your hearing is your most powerful tool. The absence of visuals creates a unique challenge and an unparalleled immersion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120790/extras/0ff079f4789369d9c8a25c8d6b293ba7.poster.avif?t=1732112877\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120790/extras/0ff079f4789369d9c8a25c8d6b293ba7.webm?t=1732112877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120790/extras/0ff079f4789369d9c8a25c8d6b293ba7.mp4?t=1732112877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Can you rely on your auditory skills to reach the entrance and complete your mission? Plug in your headphones and step into a world where sound is everything.",
